Meta.documentation:Number.greater
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Tells whether the Numbers in the flow are strictly decreasing.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Chained comparison: emits true only if each Number is greater than the next.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_default_$all — each Number to compare
Meta.documentation:@port out_Boolean_default — true if the sequence is strictly decreasing, emitted at end of input
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Number:3 Number:2 Number:1]>>Number.greater:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:true
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.less Number.equal
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
